WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.170
Describe the fictional business. Start with the operating need, business context and responsible demonstration contact.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:20.420
Define the productive asset. Explain the equipment, intended use and why the business needs it.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.670
Complete the evidence checklist. Confirm each fictional evidence placeholder and the safe-submission declaration.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:36.920
Submit for independent review. Legal, compliance and Shariah reviewers receive separate tasks. Submission is not approval.
